This is  a b s o l u t e  nonsense.  If Andy, or anyone else, can
show how the Branch Davidians could have resisted the BATF goons
in such a way as to "incapacitate" them without killing them,
please enlighten the rest of us.  I'm not talking surrender.
Just tell us some of the many ways you would have stopped the
attackers without using lethal force (i.e., force that has a
significant likelihood of causing serious injury or death).

I'm reminded of when I moved to San Francisco.  I lived with a
group of libertarian types in the Haight where we published a
magazine.  The house was overrun with mice.  The editor didn't
want us to kill them; she wanted a nice, non-lethal solution
instead.  I told her to call a hardware store and see what they
had to offer.  She called and asked if they had any mouse traps
that didn't kill the mice.  The guy at the store was silent for a
few seconds, and then replied, "Well, they don't kill them ALL
the time."  After that, in secret, the rest of us set traps and
killed mice (but not ALL the time).  It wasn't fun and it wasn't
pretty, but it was the only thing that WORKED.

